post Medal","T2","During the Rebuilding Mandate event, clear all adverse levels","You have successfully established many frontier outposts in dangerous territory in Rebuilding Mandate.\nThanks to your directives, even the most perilous environments have Rhodes Island manufacturing bases operating at high efficiency. The troubles we face now are all for the sake of a smoother road in the future.",0],["medal_activity_1vhalfidle_03","Rebuilding Combat Attire Medal","T2","During the Rebuilding Mandate event, obtain the outfit Cool Colored Rock 'n' roll","Engraved medal that comes with an outfit in Rebuilding Mandate.\nCool-colored chords reverberate freely.",0],["medal_activity_1vhalfidle_04","Rebuilding Decorator Medal","T2","During the Rebuilding Mandate event, obtain the furniture 'Emergency Record' Vivarium","A medal awarded alongside furniture in Rebuilding Mandate.\nA gift from the frontier outposts, to commemorate all the production modules you have deployed. As for the small metal crabs that came with it... Eh, an accident during transport.",0],["medal_activity_1vhalfidle_05","Rebuilding Training Medal","T2","During the Rebuilding Mandate event, promote 8 Operators in the Armory to Elite 2","You have given many operators plenty of effective manufacturing training in Rebuilding Mandate.\nEveryone here has the courage to start from scratch, and is unafraid of hardship. We'll use what Rhodes Island taught us to build Rhodes Island!",0]]}}